Analytics Event Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant SDK
    participant Server
    participant Queue
    participant Worker
    participant Database

    SDK->>Server: POST /analytics/events
    Server->>Server: Validate events
    Server->>Server: Resolve person ID:
    Note over Server: - Check existing person<br/>- Create new if needed

    Server->>Queue: Enqueue events
    Server-->>SDK: 202 Accepted

    Queue->>Worker: Dequeue batch
    Worker->>Database: Insert events (bulk)
    Worker->>Database: Update person properties
    Worker->>Database: Trigger aggregations

    Note over Database: - Funnel calculations<br/>- Retention analysis<br/>- Cohort reports